    "Ultra thick" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超厚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ultra thin" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超薄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS picks dark or light menu bar text from your wallpaper. Colors set to “Light and dark” follow that choice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 会根据墙纸选择深色或浅色的菜单栏文字。设为“浅色和深色”的颜色会随之变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "style, color, tint, gradient, glass, material, outline, border, shadow, rounded, pills, notch" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords, comma separated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "样式, 颜色, 色调, 渐变, 玻璃, 材质, 描边, 边框, 阴影, 圆角, 胶囊, 刘海, 外观"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Show menu bar background” is on, so macOS draws its own background and these styles stay hidden. Turn it off in System Settings › Menu Bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“显示菜单栏背景”已开启，macOS 会绘制自己的背景，这些样式不会显示。可在“系统设置 › 菜单栏”中关闭它。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}